#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2259 expect=skipped domain=SJ
#note "⭐⭐ expect=noViolation -> expect=skipped, 2026-09-21. The reasoning below still holds and is why this scenario exists; what changed is HOW the engine delivers it. RSTAGE is Permissible in SJ (SENDIG-DART 1.1) and this study did not collect it, so there is no (RSTGCD, RSTAGE) pair to compare and the code-only check is FDA-SE2258's job -> the rule must not fire. Until now it did not fire because an absent column in a FUNCTION-ARGUMENT position silently made no decision: tuple(RSTGCD, RSTAGE) yielded null and the membership test abstained. The uniformity ruling (owner, 2026-09-21) folds an absent column to the present empty string in EVERY position, so the tuple became (RSTGCD, '') and legitimately matched no TT row -> it OVER-FIRED, which this scenario caught. => The rule now DECLARES RSTAGE in Requirements.Variables.All, so an absent RSTAGE SKIPS the rule: 0 findings by an auditable route instead of a silent non-decision, which is the ruling's own first half ('this column is optional and not available'). Owner, 2026-09-21: the grouping variables are where an absent variable must be clarified to skip, and these are corrections of rules that were wrong anyway. GUARD-MATRIX class V (absent target column = 0 findings) is preserved."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
dataset SJ class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Subject Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SJSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col SJSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | SJ | 001 | 1 | ST1 | 2020-01-01
S1 | SJ | 002 | 1 | ST2 | 2020-02-01
---

dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col TTSTRL  type=Char label="Repro Stage Start Rule"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating | FIRST DOSE
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation | GD 0
---
